      "edge_cases": [
        "A cut can never add material back.",
        "Lifting ends a stroke; it does not roll back material already removed by valid stroke steps.",
        "A failed pre-snap insertion consumes no test.",
        "Replacement cannot restore the consumed first blank.",
        "Timer reaching zero immediately wins priority over recovery UI and routes to failure."
      ],
